# Cross-origin isolation (#400 A): COOP + COEP make crossOriginIsolated === true, enabling
# SharedArrayBuffer for multithreaded llama.cpp (wllama) and ONNX Runtime (TTS).
# `credentialless` keeps cross-origin no-cors loads working; model hosts are fetched with CORS.
# Keep in sync with src/utils/crossOriginIsolation.ts and vite.config.ts.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
  Header always set Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy "same-origin"
  Header always set Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy "credentialless"
</IfModule>
